Phase 5 + 6 — Kanban Empty State & Column Management

WHAT:
- Cleared INITIAL_CARDS in seedNotesData.ts so new Kanban notes start empty
- Removed dummy placeholder cards that appeared on every new board
- Injected custom trash buttons into SVAR Kanban column headers via React portals (ColIdInjector)
- Implemented inline column rename: double-click title -> native input replaces label text
- Implemented column deletion: trash button removes column and all its cards atomically

WHY:
SVAR React Kanban (@svar-ui/react-kanban) has no API for custom column header templates.
We bypassed this by using DOM mutation + ReactDOM.createPortal to inject buttons into
.wx-column-header elements. The SVAR native 'add column' modal was replaced with
direct inline editing to match a native desktop app feel (Trello/Linear-style).

FILES: NotesKanban.tsx, seedNotesData.ts, kanban-dark.css
